<BRK/>
<NPR>The following thicknesses of rubber flooring are recommended for the traffic 
type shown: <MET> 2.0 mm</MET><ENG> 0.080 inch</ENG> thickness - low traffic;<MET> 2.5 mm</MET><ENG> 0.100 inch</ENG> thickness 
- medium traffic;<MET> 3 mm</MET><ENG> 0.118 inch</ENG> thickness or greater - heavy traffic.</NPR><BRK/>
