inches</ENG> to<MET> [0.08] [_____] m</MET><ENG> [5/16] [_____] inches</ENG> thick.  <TAI OPT="NAVY">[Provide cork-faced MDF tongue-and-groove planks with 
cork facing.]</TAI>  Do not use products made with urea-formaldehyde binder.</TXT><BRK/>
